Oxygen Not Included Animal Pack (Example)
Requires DTMAPI 0.6.0 or later. Although this is a content-only pack, its loading capability is provided by DTMAPI.
Adds four ranchable animals: Hatch, Drecko, Mole, and Oilfloater.

Hatch produces 1 Hatch Egg per day. It can be processed into Iron Ore ×5 and Copper Ore ×5; production equipment: Chicken Coop;
Drecko produces 1 Drecko Egg every 3 days. It can be processed into Wool ×3; production equipment: Lint Roller;
Mole produces 1 Mole Egg per day. It can be processed into Raw Meat ×10; production equipment: Milking Machine;
Oilfloater produces 1 Oilfloater Egg per day. It can be processed into Coal ×20 and Resin ×5; production equipment: Hive Box.

Hidden products:
Hatch threshold 60: produces a Petrified Hatch Egg, which can be processed into Gold Ore ×10 and Titanium Ore ×5;
Drecko threshold 60: produces Lanolin ×3;
Mole threshold 40: produces a Fertile Mole Egg, which can be processed into Raw Meat ×5 and Organic Fertilizer ×30;
Oilfloater threshold 120: produces a Polymer Oilfloater Egg, which can be processed into Rubber ×30 and Plastic ×30.
Purchasing and equipment: Visit Kenenimuu's Animal Shop to buy the four juvenile animal bags: Hatch 800G, Drecko 3000G, Mole 5000G, and Oilfloater 1200G.
Each adult animal sells for three times the corresponding juvenile purchase price.
The same shop always sells the Small Animal Care Station Blueprint for 1000G. Use the blueprint to unlock its recipe, then craft the Small Animal Care Station at the Equipment Workbench with Copper Ingots ×5 and Wood ×100. Insert ordinary eggs or any of the three rare eggs to process them. Processing takes 1h and power consumption is 1.

This is an example mod built on DTMAPI's animal-extension capability. The tutorial documentation will be updated later. Authors only need to configure PNG, WAV, and JSON files to add ranchable animals. We hope you enjoy it. If you find a bug, please report it; if you like the mod, please leave a positive rating ♥️
